Below is the implementation of the Ruby on Rails application based on the provided OpenAPI schema. The application will store credit card numbers and their associations with phone numbers in an SQLite database (`db.sqlite3`). It provides two endpoints: one for associating a credit card with a phone number and another for retrieving credit cards associated with a set of phone numbers.

